            "icon": "check"
          }
        },
        "q_4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How soon will I see results?",
            "answer": "<p>Many people notice brighter, more even-looking skin within the first week of regular use. Dark spots continue to look more faded with continued use over several weeks.</p>",
            "icon": "clock"
          }
        },
        "q_5": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is it safe for sensitive skin?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes — the formula includes Centella Asiatica to help calm irritation, and the soft cotton weave is gentle enough for all skin types. We still recommend a patch test if you have known sensitivities.</p>",
            "icon": "shield"
          }
        },
        "q_6": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do you offer a money-back guarantee?",
